msgctxt "SettingsBody"
msgid "Bilby goes by what its sources say: Steam's adult-only marks, an app's own age rating, and its list of well-known adult sites. A site it has never heard of is not recognised, and most sources say nothing about age at all."
msgstr "Bilby 依据来源提供的信息判断：Steam 的仅限成人标记、应用自身的年龄分级，以及它收录的知名成人网站列表。它没听说过的网站无法识别，而且大多数来源根本不提供年龄信息。"

msgctxt "SettingsBody"
msgid "Bilby keeps a short list, chosen by people, of the apps and websites nearly everyone looks for: a browser, a video player, the big names. On, the home page starts with them in the version for this device, and they are placed a little higher in a search. Off, you get only what the sources' own figures say."
msgstr "Bilby 有一份由人工挑选的简短列表，收录几乎人人都会找的应用和网站：浏览器、视频播放器和各大知名应用。开启后，首页会先展示它们适合此设备的版本，搜索时它们的排名也会略微靠前。关闭后，只按来源自身的数据显示。"

